<title>USA: Kollmorgen Corp to acquire Servotronix.</title>
<headline>Kollmorgen Corp to acquire Servotronix.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kollmorgen Corp said Wednesday that it has increased its ownership in Servotronix Ltd to 80 percent and agreed to acquire the remaining shares over the next two years.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Kollmorgen said it previously held a 25 percent ownership stake in the company, which is an Israeli-based developer of software for precision electronic motors and drives.</p>
<p>Kollmorgen is a producer of high-performance motion- control equipment, controls, and electro-optical systems.</p>
</text>
